28:17Z","value":23,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3304670","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1846651706692098","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updates (v.0.9.8)","summary":"Hello Everyone, As you probably noticed on our previous announcement, that we're teaming up with Big Fan Games, They're awesome partner to work with and we're super excited to inform you that we'll be finally able to release Acts of Blood soon.In the meantime, here are some improvements we've made for the Steam Next Fest demo build:NEW FEATURES Added Hub activities.Added hair customization.Added a magazine collectible display.Added more skill trees (demo version).Added a proper Arena Mode scorin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:15:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692098","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1846651706675725","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"announcement","title":"Acts of Blood launches December 4th, 2026!","summary":"Hey everyone,We know a lot of you have been waiting for a release date, and we’re excited to finally be able to put one on the calendar. Acts of Blood launches on Steam on December 4, 2026!IGN revealed our new trailer today with a closer look at some of the combat, weapons and finishing moves you’ll be able to pull off. We hope you like it!Big Fan Games joins the fightThere’s another piece of news we’ve been looking forward to sharing: Big Fan Games will be publishing Acts of Blood, working alon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T22:05:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675725","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1828894815564043","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updates (v.0.9.7)","summary":"Hello Everyone, Here are some improvements we've made for the latest demo build:Moveset ComboAdded new / improved cinematic finishers (still experimental)Added new finisher movesAdded 2 new punch combo set movesAdded 1 new kick combo set movesEnemyAdded new elite enemy typeAdded new background NPC characters on story level.Improved factory brute enemy modelMiscellaneousImproved all characters facial animationImproved fight sound fxImproved all levels lighting optimizationMajor tweak on overall v","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-05T17:21:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815564043","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1819386365111255","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updates (v.0.9.5)","summary":"Hello Everyone, Earlier this year, we announced that we'll halt the demo update to work on the full game. We're happy to inform you that the development for the full game is going very smoothly. Therefore, we decide to give you some sneak peek on the full development by updating the Demo. Hope you'll enjoy them during this holidays. Here are some improvements we've made for the latest demo build:Major Update: Added 2 brand new Arena Mode levelsImproved the overall combat system (tweaked attack a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-28T06:47:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365111255","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1810503566508719","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updates End, Focusing on Full Game Development","summary":"Hello Everyone, As announced in December, We'd like to officially announce that we'll stop updating our Demo build. As promised, the Demo will stay available for you to play, hopefully you'll keep having a good time with it. Currently, we're putting all of our focus on developing the full game for the past few months onward. Hopefully we can deliver something fun and enjoyable in near future, more exciting updates to come. We're really grateful for all the supports for Acts of Blood. Thank you f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-14T08:56:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1810503566508719","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1801617199363978","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Changelog (v.0.9.1)","summary":"Here are some improvements we've made for the latest demo build: Improvements: Improved and reworked all user interfaces Reworked skill tree menu Reworked options menu Improved combat fluidity and animations Improved combat sound effects Improved enemy AI attack behavior Improved main character's attack range Changes & Fixes: Fixed collision bugs in Story and Arena mode levels Fixed unoptimized Blueprints Fixed main character's idle transition animation Fixed main character's gait change animati","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-04T16:18:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1801617199363978","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1797820624557716","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Changelog (v.0.9)","summary":"Here are some adjustments we've made for the latest demo build: Improvements: Improved overall combat system. Improved attack animation's root motion, less punching the air when attacking from far away. Improved attack enemy in different direction, hit point will now magnetize, so no more punching the air. Improved parkour system, better landing reactions. Improved footstep foley sounds, no more overlapping sounds. Improved walking animation, no more sliding. Improved tutorial popout, fewer word","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-27T13:17:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1797820624557716","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1793384379411767","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Changelog (v.0.8.9)","summary":"Here are some adjustments we've made for the latest demo build: Improvements: Improved overall gun mechanics. Separated gun ammo amount and durability bar. Guns won't disappear when ammo reaches zero. Improved enemy projectile hit reactions & damage points, making them more accurate based on body parts. Improved overall camera system, making it more dynamic. Improved overall combat system. Players no longer stick to enemies like a magnet when attacking; they must manually move and direct attacks","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-07T17:16:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1793384379411767","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1790214123083063","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Changelog (v.0.8.8)","summary":"Thank you for playing our demo! Here are some adjustments we've made for the latest demo build: Improvements: Enhanced overall combat system with smoother animations and movement Reworked attack combo system for better responsiveness and effectiveness Improved ragdoll physics Upgraded Hendra's face model Polished jogging animation start Adjusted hit point balancing Refined attack motion warping Improved attack animation timing New Additions: Added a push action (Q / LS) for better crowd control ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-01-30T13:39:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1790214123083063","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1789039014353889","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"announcement","title":"Acts of Blood X Machine56","summary":"Hello Everyone, Happy New Year! We hope you enjoyed your holiday. Opening this year, we have some exciting news, We're happy to announce our collaboration with Machine56. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45052738/a58c8ec9ac28c850f6b2b7818ff97957d3264408.png Machine56 or M56 for short, is a renown streetwear brand from Bandung-Indonesia, the same city as Eksil Team. We on Eksil Team, are big fans of their works. Seeing that they always trying to create the best product for their niche audience. The same value ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-01-17T03:14:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1789039014353889","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1786573930973965","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"announcement","title":"End of Year greetings from Eksil Team","summary":"Hello Everyone, Approaching the end of this year, we want to extend our gratitude for all support you gave to Acts of Blood. It's been an incredible experience interacting with you guys, more than we can ever wish for. We hope you a Happy New Year! Originally, we planned to only keep the demo for 2 months, but seeing that a lot of players still playing and having a good time with it, we decided that we will keep the demo. On the other hand, as we want to put more focus working on the full game f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-12-30T14:44:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1786573930973965","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1786573930745817","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Changelog (v.0.8.7)","summary":"Hello everyone, Thank you for your patience, We have a couple of good news, We're happy to announce that we just won Best Indonesian Newcomer awards on Gamers 2 Gamers Festival 2024 by The Lazy Monday media. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45052738/6a47b8261d280cd536a64c8dd870c9d2595c414c.jpg And after cooking for a while, we managed to fix and improve some aspects. We also managed to implement some exciting features! We hope to hear more feedbacks from you related to the changes. Changelog details are as fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-12-23T09:01:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1786573930745817","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1783872411978687","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Changelog (v.0.8.6)","summary":"Thank you for playing our Demo, Here some of adjustment that we made for the Demo build Improve character's light & heavy attack, counter & finisher motion warping Rebalance enemy difficulty Fix issue where gun can still shoot when not aiming Fix minor motion warping glitch Fix counter button notif sometime doesn't show up Fix demo store page menu selection bug Fix arena mode enemy doesn't attack / spawn by destroying the unused weapons over time Fix enemies became unresponsive to damage after a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-11-21T11:26:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1783872411978687","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-1783238125176902","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Changelog (v.0.8.5)","summary":"Thank you for playing our Demo, Here some of adjustment that we made for the Demo build Add hardcore mode Balance counter enemy's counter window Improve fighting base movement Improve lock on button responsivenes Improve counter UI stat responsivenes Improve counter attack system overall Improve hendra base model Fix F button doesn't pick up object in radius Fix gun position change when performing gun finisher move Fix the need for the player to wait for the enemy to get up to perform a finisher","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-11-13T11:24:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1783238125176902","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-6148070194801630139","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Changelog (v.0.8.4.7)","summary":"Thank you for playing our Demo, Here some of small adjustment that we made for the Demo build Enemy's guard counter attack / break system update: Player can counter an enemy's counter, by pressing counter button at the right time. Break the enemy's guard / stamina, by pressing the light attack button. Crowd control & break enemy's guard, by pressing the heavy attack button. Fix bug where player sometimes cannot exit the apartment Improve Invert Camera Option to support vertically as well Fix pla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-11-08T14:11:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6148070194801630139","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-6148070194801568753","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Changelog","summary":"Thank you for playing our Demo, To be honest we're quite surprised by tremendous support that the community shows to Acts of Blood, we're really grateful for that. Here some of small adjustment that we made for the Demo build Add Indonesian VO fix bug where enemy stop attacking in arena after 50 kills fix always jump attack when pressing shift fix level collision on some areas improve punching sound FX balancing enemy difficulty fix enemy stop spawning at 100 kill in arena mode fix factory purge","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-11-06T17:19:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6148070194801568753","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3031890-6146943657173931795","game_id":"steam-3031890","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo build for Acts of Blood is Live Today","summary":"Hello everyone, First, we’d like to thank you for supporting Acts of Blood. We are excited to Announce that the Demo build for Acts of Blood is Live now. About Acts of Blood: Acts of Blood is a fast paced and intense action beat 'em up game, with a strong focus on hand-to-hand combat and using weapons to take down enemies. There's also Destructible environments, melee and firearms weapon choices, and basic parkour movements. What you can expect o